flowchart TB
    GUIDEBOOK[184 頁指南手冊]

    subgraph AGENT_ASSISTED[Agent 輔助工作]
        direction LR
        EXTRACTION[記錄中繼資料、轉繪頁面<br/>並產生擷取候選項目]
        RESEARCH[研究候選第一方目的地]
        CANDIDATE[候選目的地]
    end

    subgraph HUMAN_VERIFICATION[人工審閱與客戶確認]
        direction LR
        VISUAL_REVIEW[逐頁進行視覺驗證]
        CONTENT_MODEL[確認 48 個簡介、四大支柱<br/>及準確頁面範圍]
        EVIDENCE_GATE{來源是否已確認？}
        PUBLISH[加入官方連結]
        PENDING[不顯示該連結]
    end

    subgraph AUTOMATED_TESTS[自動化驗證]
        direction LR
        CONTENT_TESTS[測試數量、支柱分佈、頁面對應、<br/>標準網址、唯一性及來源狀態]
        INTERFACE_TESTS[測試雙語內容與介面合約]
    end

    TYPED_CONTENT[雙語型別化內容]
    INTERFACE[品牌與指南手冊介面]

    GUIDEBOOK --> EXTRACTION
    EXTRACTION --> VISUAL_REVIEW
    VISUAL_REVIEW --> CONTENT_MODEL
    CONTENT_MODEL --> RESEARCH
    RESEARCH --> CANDIDATE
    CANDIDATE --> EVIDENCE_GATE
    EVIDENCE_GATE -->|是| PUBLISH
    EVIDENCE_GATE -.->|否| PENDING
    PUBLISH --> TYPED_CONTENT
    PENDING -.->|保留沒有連結的狀態| TYPED_CONTENT
    TYPED_CONTENT --> CONTENT_TESTS
    CONTENT_TESTS --> INTERFACE_TESTS
    INTERFACE_TESTS --> INTERFACE

    classDef agent fill:#e4f1f7,stroke:#356a7d,color:#16333d
    classDef human fill:#f7eadf,stroke:#8a5834,color:#442a18
    classDef automated fill:#f0eef5,stroke:#675b79,color:#312a3a
    classDef output fill:#eaf4e1,stroke:#48633c,color:#20301b
    class EXTRACTION,RESEARCH,CANDIDATE agent
    class VISUAL_REVIEW,CONTENT_MODEL,EVIDENCE_GATE,PUBLISH,PENDING human
    class CONTENT_TESTS,INTERFACE_TESTS automated
    class GUIDEBOOK,TYPED_CONTENT,INTERFACE output
